flowchart LR
    subgraph ClientHost[Client host]
        GUI[Native egui GUI]
        Session[(Session token and preferences)]
        CA[Pinned public CA]
        GUI --- Session
        GUI --- CA
    end

    subgraph BrokerHost[Broker trust boundary]
        Broker[Chatty broker]
        DB[(SQLite database)]
        Broker <--> DB
    end

    subgraph ModelHost[External inference boundary]
        Model[Ollama or OpenAI-compatible server]
    end

    GUI <-->|TLS 1.3\nJSON handshake then bincode/zstd frames| Broker
    Broker <-->|HTTP streamed generation\nmodel discovery and optional Ollama controls| Model

    Broker --> Auth[Auth and authorization]
    Broker --> RP[Context compiler and RP orchestration]
    Broker --> Sync[Revision log and live deltas]
    Broker --> Stream[Batching, cancellation, backpressure]
